# Oracle host SSH ed25519 public key (age recipient for rekey).
#
# Capture from the running Ubuntu instance BEFORE first NixOS deploy:
#   ssh-keyscan <oracle-ip> | grep ed25519
# and paste the resulting line here. First deploy must use --copy-host-keys
# so this same host key persists into the NixOS install, letting agenix
# decrypt on first boot.
